{"seq":3,"slug":"planning-and-reasoning","title":"规划与推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/foundations/planning-and-reasoning","wordCount":1480,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"规划与推理\">规划与推理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>规划是 Agent 把「一个模糊的大目标」变成「一串可执行的小步骤」的能力，也是它区别于简单 Chatbot 的分水岭。理解规划要分清三个彼此关联但不同的概念：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>典型手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>任务分解</td>\n<td>目标由哪些子任务构成？</td>\n<td>自顶向下规划、逐步展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计划执行</td>\n<td>谁来做、按什么顺序做？</td>\n<td>Plan-and-Execute、分离规划器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反思与修正</td>\n<td>做错了怎么发现并纠正？</td>\n<td>反思机制、自我批评</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>规划的本质是「把不确定性后置」还是「前置」的权衡。</strong> 自顶向下一次性规划好所有步骤，好处是全局视野清晰、可并行、可审阅；代价是计划一旦与事实不符就全盘作废。逐步展开则是走一步看一步，好处是能根据中间结果动态调整，代价是容易陷入局部、缺乏全局一致性。真实系统往往混合使用：高层用自顶向下划出大致骨架，低层用逐步展开填细节。</p>\n<p><strong>反思是把「执行」和「评估」分开。</strong> 单纯的执行 Agent 只有一条前向路径，不会回头质疑自己。反思机制引入第二个视角——让模型（或另一个模型）审查刚才的输出，找出逻辑漏洞或不一致，再据此修正。这是用额外的推理成本换取更高的正确率，因此需要判断「在哪些步骤值得反思」而不是无差别地到处反思。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    G[&quot;目标&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;任务分解&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; P[&quot;计划&lt;br/&gt;Step 1..N&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; E[&quot;执行&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; R[&quot;反思/自我批评&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt;|发现问题| D&#10;    R --&gt;|通过| F[&quot;交付&quot;]\">graph TD\n    G[\"目标\"] --&gt; D[\"任务分解\"]\n    D --&gt; P[\"计划&lt;br/&gt;Step 1..N\"]\n    P --&gt; E[\"执行\"]\n    E --&gt; R[\"反思/自我批评\"]\n    R --&gt;|发现问题| D\n    R --&gt;|通过| F[\"交付\"]</pre><h2 id=\"任务分解\">任务分解</h2><p>复杂任务很少能一步完成。Agent 的规划能力——将高层目标拆解为可执行的子任务序列——是其区别于简单 Chatbot 的核心能力。任务分解（Task Decomposition）是规划的第一步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    G[&quot;高层目标&lt;br/&gt;构建一个天气查询 API&quot;] --&gt; S1[&quot;子任务 1&lt;br/&gt;设计 API 接口&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; S2[&quot;子任务 2&lt;br/&gt;实现天气数据获取&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; S3[&quot;子任务 3&lt;br/&gt;添加缓存层&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; S4[&quot;子任务 4&lt;br/&gt;编写测试&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; S2&#10;    S2 --&gt; S3&#10;    S3 --&gt; S4\">flowchart TD\n    G[\"高层目标&lt;br/&gt;构建一个天气查询 API\"] --&gt; S1[\"子任务 1&lt;br/&gt;设计 API 接口\"]\n    G --&gt; S2[\"子任务 2&lt;br/&gt;实现天气数据获取\"]\n    G --&gt; S3[\"子任务 3&lt;br/&gt;添加缓存层\"]\n    G --&gt; S4[\"子任务 4&lt;br/&gt;编写测试\"]\n    S1 --&gt; S2\n    S2 --&gt; S3\n    S3 --&gt; S4</pre><p>任务分解有两种主要策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自顶向下</td>\n<td>先生成完整计划，再逐步执行</td>\n<td>目标明确、步骤可预见的任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐步展开</td>\n<td>每完成一步再规划下一步</td>\n<td>依赖中间结果、不确定性高的任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from openai import OpenAI&#10;&#10;client = OpenAI()&#10;&#10;def decompose_task(goal: str) -&gt; list[str]:&#10;    response = client.chat.completions.create(&#10;        model=&quot;gpt-5.6-terra&quot;,&#10;        messages=[&#10;            {&#10;                &quot;role&quot;: &quot;system&quot;,&#10;                &quot;content&quot;: &quot;将用户的目标分解为 3-7 个具体的子任务。每个子任务应该是独立可执行的。以 JSON 数组格式返回。&quot;&#10;            },&#10;            {&quot;role&quot;: &quot;user&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: goal}&#10;        ],&#10;        response_format={&quot;type&quot;: &quot;json_object&quot;}&#10;    )&#10;    import json&#10;    result = json.loads(response.choices[0].message.content)&#10;    return result[&quot;tasks&quot;]&#10;&#10;tasks = decompose_task(&quot;为电商网站构建一个商品推荐系统&quot;)&#10;for i, task in enumerate(tasks, 1):&#10;    print(f&quot;{i}. {task}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> openai </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAI()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> decompose_task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(goal: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.chat.completions.create(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-5.6-terra\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        messages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"system\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"将用户的目标分解为 3-7 个具体的子任务。每个子任务应该是独立可执行的。以 JSON 数组格式返回。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: goal}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        response_format</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"json_object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json.loads(response.choices[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].message.content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tasks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decompose_task(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"为电商网站构建一个商品推荐系统\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, task </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tasks, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">. </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"plan-and-execute-模式\">Plan-and-Execute 模式</h2><p>Plan-and-Execute 是一种将规划与执行分离的 Agent 架构。它先由一个「规划者」生成完整计划，再由一个「执行者」逐步执行每个步骤。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    U[&quot;用户目标&quot;] --&gt; P[&quot;Planner&lt;br/&gt;(规划 LLM)&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; Plan[&quot;计划&lt;br/&gt;Step 1..N&quot;]&#10;    Plan --&gt; E1[&quot;Executor&lt;br/&gt;执行 Step 1&quot;]&#10;    E1 --&gt; R1[&quot;结果 1&quot;]&#10;    R1 --&gt; E2[&quot;Executor&lt;br/&gt;执行 Step 2&quot;]&#10;    E2 --&gt; R2[&quot;结果 2&quot;]&#10;    R2 --&gt; RE[&quot;Replanner&lt;br/&gt;根据结果调整计划&quot;]&#10;    RE --&gt;|计划更新| E3[&quot;Executor&lt;br/&gt;执行 Step 3&quot;]&#10;    E3 --&gt; F[&quot;最终输出&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    U[\"用户目标\"] --&gt; P[\"Planner&lt;br/&gt;(规划 LLM)\"]\n    P --&gt; Plan[\"计划&lt;br/&gt;Step 1..N\"]\n    Plan --&gt; E1[\"Executor&lt;br/&gt;执行 Step 1\"]\n    E1 --&gt; R1[\"结果 1\"]\n    R1 --&gt; E2[\"Executor&lt;br/&gt;执行 Step 2\"]\n    E2 --&gt; R2[\"结果 2\"]\n    R2 --&gt; RE[\"Replanner&lt;br/&gt;根据结果调整计划\"]\n    RE --&gt;|计划更新| E3[\"Executor&lt;br/&gt;执行 Step 3\"]\n    E3 --&gt; F[\"最终输出\"]</pre><p>这种架构的优势在于规划者可以使用更强大的模型，而执行者可以使用更快更便宜的模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PlanStep {&#10;  id: number;&#10;  description: string;&#10;  dependencies: number[];&#10;  status: &#39;pending&#39; | &#39;in_progress&#39; | &#39;completed&#39; | &#39;failed&#39;;&#10;  result?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Plan {&#10;  goal: string;&#10;  steps: PlanStep[];&#10;  currentStep: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function planAndExecute(goal: string): Promise&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  const plan: Plan = await generatePlan(goal);&#10;&#10;  for (const step of plan.steps) {&#10;    step.status = &#39;in_progress&#39;;&#10;    try {&#10;      step.result = await executeStep(step, plan);&#10;      step.status = &#39;completed&#39;;&#10;    } catch (error) {&#10;      step.status = &#39;failed&#39;;&#10;      const revisedPlan = await replan(plan, error);&#10;      plan.steps = revisedPlan.steps;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return synthesizeResults(plan);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PlanStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_progress'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Plan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  goal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PlanStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currentStep</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> planAndExecute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">goal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> plan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Plan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generatePlan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(goal);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plan.steps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    step.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_progress'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      step.result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> executeStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(step, plan);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      step.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      step.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> revisedPlan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> replan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(plan, error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      plan.steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revisedPlan.steps;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> synthesizeResults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(plan);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"推理模型-规划范式的重构\">推理模型：规划范式的重构</h2><p>2025 年以来，以 OpenAI 的 o 系列与 GPT-5.x、Anthropic 的 extended thinking 模式、开源的 DeepSeek-R1（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.12948\">arXiv:2501.12948</a>）为代表的<strong>推理模型</strong>（Reasoning Models / 长思维链模型）改变了上述格局。这类模型通过强化学习训练出在回答前进行长链推理的能力——规划不再是外置的独立步骤，而是被<strong>内化</strong>到单次调用的思考过程中。</p>\n<p>这对 Agent 架构选择有直接影响：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>外置规划（Plan-and-Execute）</th>\n<th>内置推理（推理模型）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规划位置</td>\n<td>独立的 Planner 调用，输出结构化计划</td>\n<td>单次调用内的长思维链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可控性</td>\n<td>计划可检查、可编辑、可人工审批</td>\n<td>思考过程部分可见，干预粒度较粗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本结构</td>\n<td>多次廉价调用</td>\n<td>单次调用产生大量 reasoning token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用任务</td>\n<td>步骤明确、需要审计与并行的长流程</td>\n<td>步骤隐含、依赖深层推理的复杂问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败恢复</td>\n<td>Replanner 显式重规划</td>\n<td>模型在后续轮次自行修正</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中的推荐做法是<strong>混合使用</strong>：用推理模型承担「想清楚」的部分（任务分解、歧义消解、失败归因），把执行交给带工具循环的标准模型；对成本敏感的高频路径仍走外置规划 + 便宜模型的路由组合。注意推理 token 同样计费且可能显著增加延迟，把它当作「用 token 买规划质量」的成本项纳入第六章的成本模型中。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"反思机制\">反思机制</h2><p>反思（Reflection）是 Agent 在执行过程中回顾自身表现并进行改进的能力。它可以在行动后立即触发，也可以在完成一轮任务后进行全局反思。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;执行行动&quot;] --&gt; O[&quot;获取结果&quot;]&#10;    O --&gt; R[&quot;反思&lt;br/&gt;结果是否符合预期？&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt;|是| N[&quot;继续下一步&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt;|否| C[&quot;自我批评&lt;br/&gt;哪里出了问题？&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; P[&quot;修正计划&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"执行行动\"] --&gt; O[\"获取结果\"]\n    O --&gt; R[\"反思&lt;br/&gt;结果是否符合预期？\"]\n    R --&gt;|是| N[\"继续下一步\"]\n    R --&gt;|否| C[\"自我批评&lt;br/&gt;哪里出了问题？\"]\n    C --&gt; P[\"修正计划\"]\n    P --&gt; A</pre><p>Reflexion 框架是反思机制的代表性实现（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.11366\">arXiv:2303.11366</a>），它维护一个反思记忆，让 Agent 从过去的失败中学习：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class ReflexionAgent:&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.reflections: list[str] = []&#10;&#10;    def act(self, task: str) -&gt; str:&#10;        context = self._build_context(task)&#10;        result = self._execute(context)&#10;&#10;        if not self._evaluate(result, task):&#10;            reflection = self._reflect(task, result)&#10;            self.reflections.append(reflection)&#10;            return self.act(task)&#10;&#10;        return result&#10;&#10;    def _build_context(self, task: str) -&gt; str:&#10;        reflection_text = &quot;\\n&quot;.join(&#10;            f&quot;- 经验 {i+1}: {r}&quot; for i, r in enumerate(self.reflections)&#10;        )&#10;        return f&quot;任务: {task}\\n\\n过去的经验教训:\\n{reflection_text}&quot;&#10;&#10;    def _reflect(self, task: str, failed_result: str) -&gt; str:&#10;        prompt = f&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;任务: {task}&#10;失败的尝试结果: {failed_result}&#10;&#10;请分析失败原因，总结一条简洁的经验教训，以便下次避免同样的错误。&#10;&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        return call_llm(prompt)&#10;&#10;    def _evaluate(self, result: str, task: str) -&gt; bool:&#10;        return call_llm(f&quot;结果 &#39;{result}&#39; 是否正确完成了任务 &#39;{task}&#39;？回答 yes 或 no&quot;) == &quot;yes&quot;&#10;&#10;    def _execute(self, context: str) -&gt; str:&#10;        return call_llm(context)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReflexionAgent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.reflections: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> act</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, task: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        context </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._build_context(task)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._execute(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._evaluate(result, task):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            reflection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._reflect(task, result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.reflections.append(reflection)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.act(task)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _build_context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, task: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        reflection_text </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.join(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"- 经验 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.reflections)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"任务: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">过去的经验教训:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reflection_text</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _reflect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, task: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, failed_result: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">任务: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">失败的尝试结果: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">failed_result</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">请分析失败原因，总结一条简洁的经验教训，以便下次避免同样的错误。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call_llm(prompt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _evaluate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, result: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, task: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call_llm(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"结果 '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' 是否正确完成了任务 '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'？回答 yes 或 no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"yes\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, context: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call_llm(context)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自我批评\">自我批评</h2><p>自我批评（Self-Critique）是反思的一种特殊形式，Agent 在生成输出后立即评审自己的工作，发现并修正错误。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    G[&quot;生成初稿&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;自我批评&lt;br/&gt;检查准确性、完整性&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{&quot;发现问题？&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| R[&quot;修订&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; G&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[&quot;输出最终结果&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    G[\"生成初稿\"] --&gt; C[\"自我批评&lt;br/&gt;检查准确性、完整性\"]\n    C --&gt; D{\"发现问题？\"}\n    D --&gt;|是| R[\"修订\"]\n    R --&gt; G\n    D --&gt;|否| F[\"输出最终结果\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>自我批评维度</th>\n<th>检查内容</th>\n<th>示例问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>准确性</td>\n<td>事实是否正确</td>\n<td>引用的数据是否真实？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整性</td>\n<td>是否遗漏关键信息</td>\n<td>是否覆盖了所有子任务？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>前后逻辑是否矛盾</td>\n<td>结论是否与分析一致？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可行性</td>\n<td>方案是否可执行</td>\n<td>代码能否通过编译？</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def generate_with_critique(task: str, max_revisions: int = 3) -&gt; str:&#10;    draft = call_llm(f&quot;完成以下任务:\\n{task}&quot;)&#10;&#10;    for _ in range(max_revisions):&#10;        critique = call_llm(&#10;            f&quot;请严格审查以下内容，指出所有问题:\\n\\n{draft}\\n\\n&quot;&#10;            f&quot;如果没有问题，回答「无问题」。否则列出具体问题。&quot;&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        if &quot;无问题&quot; in critique:&#10;            break&#10;&#10;        draft = call_llm(&#10;            f&quot;原始内容:\\n{draft}\\n\\n批评意见:\\n{critique}\\n\\n&quot;&#10;            f&quot;请根据批评意见修正内容。&quot;&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    return draft\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generate_with_critique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(task: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, max_revisions: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    draft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call_llm(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"完成以下任务:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(max_revisions):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        critique </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call_llm(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请严格审查以下内容，指出所有问题:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n\\n{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">draft</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"如果没有问题，回答「无问题」。否则列出具体问题。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"无问题\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> critique:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        draft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call_llm(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"原始内容:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">draft</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">批评意见:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">critique</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请根据批评意见修正内容。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> draft</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 自我批评策略能显著提升 Agent 输出质量，但也会增加 LLM 调用次数和延迟。在生产环境中需要在质量和成本之间找到平衡，通常设置 2-3 轮修订上限。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>任务分解是 Agent 规划的基础，分为自顶向下和逐步展开两种策略。</li>\n<li>Plan-and-Execute 架构将规划与执行分离，支持更灵活的模型选择和动态重新规划。</li>\n<li>推理模型把规划内化为长思维链，与外置规划各有取舍，实践中推荐按任务混合使用。</li>\n<li>反思机制让 Agent 能从失败中学习，Reflexion 框架维护反思记忆实现持续改进。</li>\n<li>自我批评通过生成-审查-修订循环提升输出质量，通常限制 2-3 轮迭代。</li>\n<li>规划与推理能力是将简单 LLM 应用升级为真正 Agent 系统的关键。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"规划与推理","id":"规划与推理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"任务分解","id":"任务分解"},{"level":2,"text":"Plan-and-Execute 模式","id":"plan-and-execute-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"推理模型：规划范式的重构","id":"推理模型-规划范式的重构"},{"level":2,"text":"反思机制","id":"反思机制"},{"level":2,"text":"自我批评","id":"自我批评"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ReAct 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/foundations/react-pattern"},"next":{"title":"记忆系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/foundations/memory-systems"}}